WEBVTT

00:11:59.480 --> 00:12:04.216
It means being aware of the impact,
of the consequences

00:12:04.240 --> 00:12:06.120
of the failure of that business.

00:12:06.920 --> 00:12:09.440
Being aware of the lessons learned.

00:12:09.960 --> 00:12:13.456
And being aware of the responsibility

00:12:13.480 --> 00:12:15.680
to share those learnings with the world.

00:12:16.400 --> 00:12:17.616
Thank you.

00:12:17.640 --> 00:12:21.080
(Applause)